WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.990
- Are you excited though,
about Halloween this weekend?

00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:04.010
Do you dress up?

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:06.990
- I, yes. I mean, I have three kids

00:00:06.990 --> 00:00:10.690
so my kids are like 12, 10, and eight.

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:13.030
So they're into it very much, so -

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:13.863
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:13.863 --> 00:00:14.696
- [Joey] There they are.

00:00:14.696 --> 00:00:16.690
- Yeah! Oh, we love carving
pumpkins at our house.

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:17.523
It's a thing.

00:00:17.523 --> 00:00:18.356
- And that's Roxy.

00:00:18.356 --> 00:00:21.490
She's a little baby underneath the table.

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:23.990
Yeah, I mean, it's going
to be funky this year

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.680
because, you know, you have to make it

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.740
as festive as possible in the house.

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.988
So, we try to decorate,
and the front yard's

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:31.990
nice and spooky and all that stuff.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:32.823
- Yeah, I know.

00:00:32.823 --> 00:00:33.900
We're doing like a whole scavenger hunt

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.060
with my kids just at my house.

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:36.420
Just, like, so they can...

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:38.100
They're four and six so
they don't really understand

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:38.933
why they can't go out,

00:00:38.933 --> 00:00:41.440
and they are really tired of the sickness.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:42.503
That's what we call it.

00:00:42.503 --> 00:00:45.370
They're like, is the sickness over yet?

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:47.023
And we're like, almost honey.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.250
- The sickness was different in my house.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.406
This is a different sickness.

00:00:51.406 --> 00:00:52.803
No, I'm kidding, I'm kidding.

00:00:52.803 --> 00:00:54.300
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:58.120
Well, people must have dressed
up as NKO TV all the time

00:00:58.120 --> 00:00:59.330
back in the day, right?

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:01.490
- They were, you know, if...

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:02.910
You needed some essentials.

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:05.800
You needed holes in your jeans and vests.

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:06.715
- Yes.

00:01:06.715 --> 00:01:07.548
- [Kelly] And vests.

00:01:07.548 --> 00:01:08.381
- Everybody had vests.

00:01:08.381 --> 00:01:10.320
Get a vest, you know?

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:12.930
Yeah, we have the most
amazing fans and we've,

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:15.704
we very much embrace the past.

00:01:15.704 --> 00:01:16.537
- Yeah.

00:01:16.537 --> 00:01:18.270
- So, we've kind of brought that look back

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:20.100
often over the years, as you can see

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:22.910
Well, that was, see I
can't even, so that was

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:24.877
a few years ago, to say the least.

00:01:24.877 --> 00:01:28.590
But we've, you know, we take
the piss out of ourselves

00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:31.310
and put those outfits back on and -

00:01:31.310 --> 00:01:32.143
- I love it, though.

00:01:32.143 --> 00:01:33.240
And here's the thing.

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:35.990
What's needed now more than
ever is nostalgia, too.

00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:38.030
Like any kind of hopeful, like fun,

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:39.900
like, I don't know, escapism.

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:42.070
Like it's, I think it's needed right now.

00:01:42.070 --> 00:01:43.740
- Like coming on "The Kelly
Clarkson Show?" I mean -

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:45.158
- Yes, exactly. This feels good to me.

00:01:45.158 --> 00:01:46.643
- I mean, thank you! I'm out of the house!

00:01:46.643 --> 00:01:47.993
- [Kelly] Feels good to me.

